licensed under GPL-2.0-only. The full licence is in
LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt.

Vendored kernel source retains its existing SPDX, copyright and licence
notices. See CREDITS.md for provenance and the source manifest for hashes.

Apple firmware, machine-specific FDRData, EFI ROM variables, the personalised
Wi-Fi board-data file and third-party branded image assets aren't included.
The community Wi-Fi template is obtained separately from its upstream source;
this project's licence doesn't grant additional rights in that data.
